      "description": "The pill nav as it sits on the night hero, with the Theme button.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-night\"><nav class=\"ds-nav\"><b>HeldAt</b><a href=\"#\">How it works</a><a href=\"#\" aria-current=\"true\">FAQ</a><button class=\"ds-theme\">Theme</button><button class=\"ds-nbtn\">Launch app</button></nav></div>",
      "css": ".ds-night{background:#090b10;padding:28px;border-radius:20px;}.ds-nav{font-family:var(--sans,\"Host Grotesk\",system-ui,sans-serif);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;height:60px;padding:0 8px 0 18px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);color:#f2f4f8;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:500}.ds-nav b{margin-right:auto;font-weight:600;font-size:17px}.ds-nav a{padding:8px 14px;border-radius:999px;color:#aab3c2;text-decoration:none;transition:color .2s,background-color .2s}.ds-nav a:hover,.ds-nav a[aria-current=\"true\"]{color:#fff;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08)}.ds-theme{font-family:var(--sans,\"Host Grotesk\",system-ui,sans-serif);height:40px;padding:0 14px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:transparent;color:#f2f4f8;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.18);cursor:pointer}.ds-theme:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.08)}.ds-nbtn{font-family:var(--sans,\"Host Grotesk\",system-ui,sans-serif);height:40px;padding:0 16px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:#0b0e14;font-weight:560;font-size:14px;cursor:pointer}.ds-nav a:focus-visible,.ds-theme:focus-visible,.ds-nbtn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#2458e8);outline-offset:3px;}"
